        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="16 KiB pages and 48 bit virtual addresses. The set index bits are measured; the walk levels follow from the ARM 16 KiB granule; the cluster shared L2 TLB is a patent reading." style="text;html=1;kind=title;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
